BT /F1 10 Tf 28 666.6 Td (1. What distinguishes a team from a group?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 653.6 Td (Answer: A team shares responsibility, authority, and resources to achieve its collective mission \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 634.6 Td (2. What is the primary definition of teamwork?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 621.6 Td (Answer: The process of working collaboratively with a group of people in order to achieve a goal \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 602.6 Td (3. Which of the following is NOT one of the four objectives of teamwork?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 589.6 Td (Answer: Competition \227 Correct) Tj ET
