BT /F1 10 Tf 28 442.6 Td (8. What happens when a team leader demonstrates a confident work ethic?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 429.6 Td (Answer: Team members mimic the leader's attitude and confidence inspires confidence \227 Correct) Tj ET
