BT /F1 10 Tf 28 634.6 Td (2. What is the defining principle of great workplaces according to the employee view?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 621.6 Td (Answer: Trust built through management credibility, respect, and fairness \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 602.6 Td (3. Which best practice involves uncovering and recognizing special skills and experimenting with roles for the right fit?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 589.6 Td (Answer: Give people the opportunity to use their skills \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 570.6 Td (4. What happens when employees cannot use their skills according to the content?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 557.6 Td (Answer: They may leave the organization \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 538.6 Td (5. What should workplace communication aim to do according to the core practices?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 525.6 Td (Answer: Solve problems, not create them \227 Correct) Tj ET
