BT /F1 10 Tf 44 621.6 Td (Answer: Excessive government regulation \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 602.6 Td (3. What is one benefit of process innovation mentioned in the content?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 589.6 Td (Answer: It reduces unit costs by improving production capacity \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 570.6 Td (4. Why is limiting innovation to one group like R&D considered a hindrance?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 557.6 Td (Answer: Each department provides a unique customer perspective \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 538.6 Td (5. According to the content, what is one risk of innovation?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 525.6 Td (Answer: Competitors may replicate innovations \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 506.6 Td (6. How does innovation help with staff retention?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 493.6 Td (Answer: Innovative businesses are seen as inspiring workplaces \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 474.6 Td (7. What type of initiatives can encourage employees to innovate?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 461.6 Td (Answer: Inventor incentive programs and contests \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 442.6 Td (8. According to the content, what happens when organizations fail to innovate during disruptions like the COVID-19) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 429.6 Td (pandemic?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 416.6 Td (Answer: Those that stuck to the status quo suffered \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 397.6 Td (9. What is one way innovation creates more added value?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 384.6 Td (Answer: By creating a unique selling proposition \(USP\) \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 365.6 Td (10. Why is diverse team composition important for innovation?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 352.6 Td (Answer: It generates a wealth of ideas from different perspectives \227 Correct) Tj ET
