BT /F1 10 Tf 44 640.6 Td (Correct answer: realize / define) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 621.6 Td (2. A ___ is a major unplanned contributor to a negative event.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 608.6 Td (Answer: Causal Factor \227 Correct) Tj ET
