BT /F1 10 Tf 44 563.6 Td (Correct answer: 5 / five) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 544.6 Td (4. ___ stands for Failure Mode and Effects Analysis.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 531.6 Td (Answer: FMEA \227 Correct) Tj ET
