BT /F1 10 Tf 44 499.6 Td (Answer: Control \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 480.6 Td (6. ___ is a Six Sigma data-driven strategy for process improvement with cyclical steps.) Tj ET
