BT /F1 10 Tf 28 461.6 Td (7. Which dimension of product quality is subjective and based on personal preference?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 448.6 Td (Answer: Aesthetics \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 429.6 Td (8. What does 'Empathy' mean in service quality parameters?) Tj ET
